  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Life; <strong>CL</strong> 1st<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 50 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe most common of healing items, this simple vial full of enchanted water tends to be the main tool of low-level adventurers trying to stave off death. A single potion heals 1d8+1 hit points.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Life sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 25 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 50 gp, 1d8+1 healing.</p><p>Only the source's single healing dose is represented. Fixed healing does not scale with the actor's CL or ability. Positive-energy handling follows the reviewed Life cure component; target application remains deliberate.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
